== Trivia ==
* While on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the '''Spider Tamer''' used {{NPCSprite|Tyzzo}}'s skin, instead of its own. This was later changed when the '''Spider Tamer''' was added to the main network.
*After giving '''Spider Tamer''' a {{Item|Tarantula Pet}} for the [[Abiphone]] Contact, a {{Level|1}} {{Item|Tarantula Pet}} will be seen floating next to him.
**Although the maximum rarity of a pet is {{Mythic}}, the pet's text color matches {{red|Spider Tamer}}, but it may imply it is somehow {{Special}}.

